  "description": "## Conversation Summary\n\n1. **Goal**: Redesign the Knowledge Index UI with better DaisyUI styling, indexing progress indicators, and an improved file list with search, extension filters, and grid layout.\n\n2. **`KnowledgeFileList.vue`** was redesigned with a search input in the header, clickable extension filter pills, a responsive grid layout (`grid-cols-1/2/3`), and checkbox selection with bulk action buttons.\n\n3. **`KnowledgeIndex.vue`** was rebuilt with a status banner, animated progress bar during indexing, stats cards (Pending/Indexed/Ignored) acting as tab selectors, and internal `indexingFiles` state tracking.\n\n4. **Bug fix**: The \"Danger Zone\" section was disappearing when file lists were large \u2014 fixed by adding `overflow-hidden` to the root, `min-h-0` to the scrollable panel (overriding flex's default `min-height: auto`), and `flex-shrink-0` to all fixed elements (banner, stats, danger zone).\n\n5. **Key CSS insight**: The root cause was that flex children default to `min-height: auto`, preventing shrinking \u2014 `min-h-0` on the file list panel forces it to shrink and scroll, keeping all other sections always visible.",
